          "name": "basalt",
          "description": "The most loved watchface for Pebble is now color!\r\n\r\nDisplay the current weather conditions and the forecast for the day by shaking your wrist twice. Optionally you can get the 3 day forecast by backing the project.\r\n\r\nYWeather tells you the time in 21 languages: english, spanish, italian, catalan, chinese, czech, danish, dutch, finnish, french, german, hungarian, japanese, norwegian, polish, portuguese, romanian, russian, slovak, swedish and turkish.\r\n\r\nGet the info than you want, displayed in the right way.",
